sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor c as Contributor
  participant fork as Contributor's fork
  participant repo as This repo
  actor m as Maintainer
  c->>fork: fork, branch, edit README.md
  c->>repo: open pull request
  m->>repo: review: format, alphabetical order, working link
  alt accepted
    m->>repo: merge
  else changes needed
    m-->>c: request changes
  end
